  "chapter_masthead": "DM02 — THE SLEEP THAT HELD VISHNU",
  "composition_hash": "db6eea857f8f62376407453095676b5d70cf1cdc250720016857ea355e7e804f",
  "engine_version": "0.8.2",
  "fixture": false,
  "fixture_mode": false,
  "font_config_sha256": "ba6cd2c0c4d716aa550059148339642da7fb2f1af1bfaad2e5d6ab838fb1e0aa",
  "layout_type": "THREE_PANEL",
  "lettering": [
    {
      "badge_number": 1,
      "box": {
        "height": 0.14,
        "width": 0.84,
        "x": 0.08,
        "y": 0.115
      },
      "channel": "NARRATION",
      "font": {
        "minimum_size": 22,
        "size": 22
      },
      "lettering_id": "p07-narration-a",
      "padding": 12,
      "panel_id": "p07-panel-01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "source_script_hash": "5177b787c102ba260f77a6b07f8b9c0826039b8e17321d030a94cb9bc941f17b",
      "speaker_id": "narrator",
      "text": "Brahma looked from the approaching figures to Vishnu. The preserver still rested upon Shesha, held in the depth of Yoganidra. No call from the lotus had yet broken that sleep.\n\nMadhu and Kaitabha came nearer."
    },
    {
      "badge_number": 2,
      "box": {
        "height": 0.27,
        "width": 0.38,
        "x": 0.545,
        "y": 0.555
      },
      "channel": "NARRATION",
      "font": {
        "minimum_size": 22,
        "size": 22
      },
      "lettering_id": "p07-narration-b",
      "padding": 12,
      "panel_id": "p07-panel-03",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "source_script_hash": "4e0855997c7027469823ae165939fcbe5f8b17cf1bf3f23491658834c4da54a3",
      "speaker_id": "narrator",
      "text": "There was nowhere for Brahma to flee. Around the lotus lay the same endless flood. Below it slept the one who could face the threat. Yet the sleep upon Vishnu was itself divine power, not an ordinary weariness that Brahma could simply shake away.\n\nThe danger and the answer stood almost together: the threatening Asuras upon the waters, Vishnu beneath the lotus, and the power of sleep holding him still."
    }
  ],
